WEBVTT

00:00:02.220 --> 00:00:04.540
Satoshi, who dreams of
becoming a Pokémon Master...

00:00:04.540 --> 00:00:07.700
And Go, who aims to
catch every Pokémon.

00:00:07.700 --> 00:00:10.960
What kind of Pokémon
will they meet today?

00:00:13.950 --> 00:00:19.740
I'm here at the port with the captain
who was saved by the Pokémon Kairyu.

00:00:19.750 --> 00:00:23.500
Let us hear what he has to say.
It must have been tough for you, right?

00:00:23.500 --> 00:00:24.270
Every now and then, you hear about Kairyu
rescuing shipwrecked people.

00:00:24.270 --> 00:00:26.550
I was at my wit's end!
Every now and then, you hear about Kairyu
rescuing shipwrecked people.

00:00:26.550 --> 00:00:27.490
Every now and then, you hear about Kairyu
rescuing shipwrecked people.

00:00:27.490 --> 00:00:29.510
Kairyu, huh?
I'd love to meet one!

00:00:29.950 --> 00:00:32.170
That might be difficult.

00:00:32.170 --> 00:00:33.630
Huh? Why?

00:00:33.630 --> 00:00:35.400
Allow me to explain!

00:00:36.720 --> 00:00:41.240
Kairyu is a Pokémon that's evolved
from Miniryu and Hakuryu.

00:00:41.240 --> 00:00:45.850
It's a very popular Pokémon,
but not many are known to live in the wild.

00:00:45.850 --> 00:00:47.570
What, really?

00:00:47.570 --> 00:00:50.090
We're not sure where
its habitat is, either.

00:00:50.090 --> 00:00:54.530
Well, there are rumors of an island
where only Kairyu live.

00:00:54.940 --> 00:00:56.350
An island where only Kairyu live?!

00:00:56.350 --> 00:00:57.830
It's just a rumor...

00:00:57.830 --> 00:00:59.290
About that...

00:00:59.290 --> 00:01:00.780
Look.

00:01:00.780 --> 00:01:03.910
I compiled all the reported sightings from the past couple of years.

00:01:03.910 --> 00:01:05.570
And then...

00:01:05.570 --> 00:01:07.930
They all seem to be focused around here.

00:01:07.930 --> 00:01:10.190
Kinda suspicious, yeah?

00:01:10.190 --> 00:01:11.930
That really is fascinating.

00:01:11.930 --> 00:01:13.030
That settles it, then!

00:01:13.030 --> 00:01:13.920
No time to waste!

00:01:14.300 --> 00:01:18.080
Let's go search for the Kairyu island!

00:01:19.390 --> 00:01:26.020
PocketMonsters

00:01:26.020 --> 00:01:28.440
Hey, you still not ready? C'mon, hurry up!

00:01:28.440 --> 00:01:31.020
You all packed and ready to leave?

00:01:31.020 --> 00:01:33.740
I'll show you this wide mysterious world

00:01:33.740 --> 00:01:36.610
And skip the slow send-off

00:01:36.610 --> 00:01:38.950
Be it through fire or through water

00:01:38.950 --> 00:01:41.620
I'm fumbling blindly through the days

00:01:41.620 --> 00:01:46.120
When I don't even know what the next second will bring

00:01:46.790 --> 00:01:51.380
Each and every one of my memories

00:01:51.380 --> 00:01:55.970
Can always be found inside a Ball

00:01:57.130 --> 00:01:59.890
On 1, 2, 3, dive in!

00:01:59.890 --> 00:02:05.640
I've got the future plans I imagined in my pocket

00:02:07.600 --> 00:02:12.650
Greeting someone new is always fresh

00:02:12.650 --> 00:02:16.860
No need (No need!) to hesitate! Try! (Try!)

00:02:16.860 --> 00:02:18.200
Let's have a fight!

00:02:18.200 --> 00:02:20.910
1: Once the battle's done

00:02:20.910 --> 00:02:22.740
2: And we're laughing or crying

00:02:22.740 --> 00:02:27.080
On 3, let's be friends!

00:02:28.370 --> 00:02:33.750
Any day and every day, that's always been my rule

00:02:33.750 --> 00:02:39.090
With this unpredictable, boundless world awaiting

00:02:39.090 --> 00:02:41.590
Let's go! Every time you trip and fall

00:02:41.590 --> 00:02:45.720
Let's go! You pick yourself up by my side

00:02:45.720 --> 00:02:47.520
I choose you!

00:02:51.100 --> 00:02:56.530
Hakuryu's Trial!
The Kairyu Paradise,

00:02:59.350 --> 00:03:02.270
Whoa! Look at all those
Monster Balls!

00:03:02.270 --> 00:03:04.600
Well, of course I'd
be fired up, yeah?

00:03:04.600 --> 00:03:08.680
I intend to complete Miniryu's
entire evolutionary line!

00:03:12.290 --> 00:03:15.940
I thought about renting a boat
to take us the rest of the way,

00:03:15.940 --> 00:03:17.930
but I might as well catch a Pokémon!

00:03:17.930 --> 00:03:19.810
There are Dewgong around here!

00:03:19.810 --> 00:03:20.820
And that means...

00:03:20.820 --> 00:03:23.390
We've got a Ride to catch!

00:03:24.120 --> 00:03:29.530
We travel all this way to get a special Kairyu
to offer up to Sakaki...

00:03:29.530 --> 00:03:32.610
...and run into the brat boys.
Who'd have guessed?

00:03:32.610 --> 00:03:35.520
They said something
about Kairyu, too.

00:03:35.520 --> 00:03:37.560
Does that mean
they're after it, too?!

00:03:37.560 --> 00:03:40.740
You gotta be kidding!
I will <i>not</i> have them stealing it from us!

00:03:40.740 --> 00:03:43.360
We gotta enact our plan,
pronto, meow!

00:03:49.960 --> 00:03:52.540
Monster Ball, go!

00:03:55.540 --> 00:03:56.550
All right!

00:04:01.580 --> 00:04:03.090
One more time!

00:04:11.450 --> 00:04:12.930
This one's tough.

00:04:12.930 --> 00:04:15.020
Fine by me!

00:04:16.150 --> 00:04:17.690
Here we go!

00:04:18.810 --> 00:04:19.810
There!

00:04:20.600 --> 00:04:21.670
Go!

00:04:22.350 --> 00:04:23.910
What?!

00:04:24.330 --> 00:04:27.410
Dewgong's data will be
added to the Index!

00:04:27.410 --> 00:04:29.040
Got it!

00:04:30.050 --> 00:04:30.870
You did it!

00:04:30.870 --> 00:04:32.080
Yeah!

00:04:37.420 --> 00:04:38.800
It's around here somewhere...

00:04:38.800 --> 00:04:39.760
Yeah.

00:04:40.880 --> 00:04:42.170
Another one!

00:04:43.010 --> 00:04:45.010
H-Hey!

00:04:45.390 --> 00:04:46.900
What's wrong, Dewgong?

00:04:52.640 --> 00:04:55.270
What?! Don't tell me...

00:05:03.150 --> 00:05:05.890
Stop! ...You're not listening, are you?

00:05:05.890 --> 00:05:07.530
Go, look!

00:05:07.530 --> 00:05:09.540
You're kidding!

00:05:18.900 --> 00:05:20.910
Dewgong, we gotta turn back.

00:06:04.940 --> 00:06:06.330
What? What?!

00:06:09.150 --> 00:06:10.630
Kairyu?

00:06:10.630 --> 00:06:12.900
Satoshi, these are Kairyu, yeah?!

00:06:12.900 --> 00:06:14.060
Yeah...

00:06:14.060 --> 00:06:15.470
They saved us.

00:06:19.230 --> 00:06:20.980
Then this must be...

00:06:20.980 --> 00:06:23.300
...the Kairyu island!

00:06:23.860 --> 00:06:27.520
We got saved by Kairyu!
What a rare experience!

00:06:27.520 --> 00:06:29.780
Thank you so much, Kairyu!

00:06:34.470 --> 00:06:36.040
All right then...

00:06:36.040 --> 00:06:38.000
Monster Ball...

00:06:38.000 --> 00:06:39.800
Wait, what? Huh?!

00:06:39.800 --> 00:06:41.880
There are no Monster Balls!

00:06:41.880 --> 00:06:43.500
Why?!

00:06:46.230 --> 00:06:49.010
Oh... Back then...

00:06:50.010 --> 00:06:55.170
It seems like we got separated
from that Dewgong, too... What did I even...?

00:06:55.170 --> 00:06:57.900
Um... Wanna use my Monster Ball?

00:06:57.900 --> 00:07:01.010
No, thanks...
You might want to use it yourself...

00:07:09.480 --> 00:07:11.610
You've become friends,
Pikachu?

00:07:15.970 --> 00:07:18.000
Are they trying to show us around?

00:07:18.000 --> 00:07:20.970
All right!
Let's explore the Kairyu island!

00:07:30.970 --> 00:07:33.850
There's Kairyu wherever you look!

00:07:33.850 --> 00:07:35.350
Hang on...

00:07:35.350 --> 00:07:37.470
Rotom, tell me where we are.

00:07:38.860 --> 00:07:42.020
GPS signal not found!

00:07:42.020 --> 00:07:43.230
I've got no coverage!

00:07:48.770 --> 00:07:50.330
Hakuryu!

00:08:07.020 --> 00:08:08.680
It's so pretty!

00:08:27.190 --> 00:08:30.230
So that's how Hakuryu fly!

00:08:35.120 --> 00:08:36.070
Hibunny?!

00:08:36.070 --> 00:08:37.740
What's that?!

00:08:42.390 --> 00:08:44.200
A Miniryu's cast-off skin?

00:08:44.860 --> 00:08:46.380
Where'd you find this?

00:08:51.380 --> 00:08:53.030
How far are we going?

00:08:58.850 --> 00:09:00.770
Awesome!

00:09:03.220 --> 00:09:05.010
There's so many!

00:09:05.820 --> 00:09:07.650
Go! Over there!

00:09:15.590 --> 00:09:17.500
Is it evolving?

00:09:17.500 --> 00:09:18.370
You can do it!

00:09:26.370 --> 00:09:28.180
It's molting!

00:09:31.380 --> 00:09:32.130
This good?

00:09:32.130 --> 00:09:34.810
Stretch it a bit more,
so we can see its shape better.

00:09:35.480 --> 00:09:36.640
All right, that's good!

00:09:40.610 --> 00:09:45.500
Miniryu's cast-off skin is really valuable.
Boots made from it are a super luxury item.

00:09:45.500 --> 00:09:46.770
Really?

00:09:47.260 --> 00:09:50.140
But Pokémon
sure are mysterious, huh?

00:09:50.140 --> 00:09:50.980
How so?

00:09:50.980 --> 00:09:55.460
You know, Miniryu,
Hakuryu, and Kairyu...

00:09:55.990 --> 00:09:58.140
Kairyu kinda sticks out.

00:09:59.550 --> 00:10:03.700
Now that you mention it, you'd think it'd become
something more like Milokaross.

00:10:03.700 --> 00:10:04.710
I know, right?

00:10:05.520 --> 00:10:08.210
Why does it get arms and legs?

00:10:17.760 --> 00:10:18.790
What?

00:10:23.950 --> 00:10:28.840
Hey, Satoshi. I think I've figured out
the secret of this island.

00:10:28.840 --> 00:10:30.160
Secret?

00:10:30.160 --> 00:10:31.060
Tell me!

00:10:31.440 --> 00:10:34.820
Watching the Hakuryu
play earlier, I realized...

00:10:35.360 --> 00:10:39.380
Hakuryu is said to have the ability
to change the weather.

00:10:39.380 --> 00:10:43.160
It's a sign of them
releasing their power.

00:10:43.200 --> 00:10:49.330
Meaning, this island is constantly surrounded
by storms caused by Hakuryu's power,

00:10:49.330 --> 00:10:51.640
and that's why nobody's found it.

00:10:54.390 --> 00:10:56.720
Now that you mention it,
that could be.

00:10:56.720 --> 00:10:59.160
Or, I should say,
you're awesome!

00:10:59.160 --> 00:11:00.400
Well, of course I am, y-

00:11:00.400 --> 00:11:01.450
Oh, it's the sea!

00:11:01.450 --> 00:11:02.180
What?!

00:11:19.770 --> 00:11:22.250
Looks like the storm
doesn't bother them one bit...

00:11:31.590 --> 00:11:33.830
That one can't fly?

00:12:08.540 --> 00:12:11.710
Hey! Let's train together!

00:12:14.750 --> 00:12:15.410
PocketMonsters

00:12:15.410 --> 00:12:17.270
Pocket Monsters!
PocketMonsters

00:12:17.270 --> 00:12:21.550
PocketMonsters

00:12:21.550 --> 00:12:26.470
Flying
. Dragon .
Kairyu
PocketMonsters

00:12:31.100 --> 00:12:33.300
One more time, Hakuryu!

00:12:33.300 --> 00:12:34.870
Ready, and...

00:12:40.040 --> 00:12:41.470
Satoshi!

00:12:41.470 --> 00:12:45.520
Did you notice the other Hakuryu making
some weird movements before they started flying?

00:12:46.740 --> 00:12:49.220
They were twirling around...
Kind of like a dance...

00:12:49.220 --> 00:12:52.390
Dance? Could it be
Dragon Dance?

00:12:52.390 --> 00:12:54.460
Rotom, what's Dragon Dance?

00:12:55.080 --> 00:13:01.760
Dragon Dance! A focused dance
that boosts the user's physical abilities!

00:13:01.760 --> 00:13:03.560
Bingo! Bingo!

00:13:03.560 --> 00:13:06.640
The Hakuryu were using this move
to take off!

00:13:06.640 --> 00:13:09.130
All right! Time for
a Dragon Dance, Hakuryu!

00:13:09.130 --> 00:13:11.640
I'll do it, so watch and learn!

00:13:12.270 --> 00:13:14.590
<i>You’ll</i> do it?!

00:13:14.590 --> 00:13:16.650
Dragon Dance, Dragon Dance...

00:13:16.650 --> 00:13:18.000
I know!

00:13:21.400 --> 00:13:23.490
Are you sure?

00:13:23.490 --> 00:13:26.910
I'll be fine!
This'll let me move in the air!

00:13:26.910 --> 00:13:28.780
Pay attention, Hakuryu!

00:13:28.780 --> 00:13:30.530
Pikachu! Electroweb!

00:13:37.560 --> 00:13:38.210
All right!

00:13:38.680 --> 00:13:40.510
Check this out, Hakuryu!

00:13:46.910 --> 00:13:50.710
See? You can't use Electroweb
as a trampoline.

00:13:50.710 --> 00:13:51.600
I'm fine.

00:13:51.600 --> 00:13:53.670
Pikachu! Do it again!

00:13:53.670 --> 00:13:54.880
Electroweb!

00:14:06.400 --> 00:14:08.180
Satoshi...

00:14:10.060 --> 00:14:11.400
Try again...

00:14:11.920 --> 00:14:15.410
We figured out how Hakuryu fly.

00:14:15.910 --> 00:14:18.420
I'd better give it
a good demonstration!

00:14:20.170 --> 00:14:23.000
Pikachu! Electroweb!

00:14:29.140 --> 00:14:30.340
Here goes!

00:14:34.310 --> 00:14:35.180
That's it!

00:14:35.540 --> 00:14:38.190
Spin some more, Hakuryu!

00:14:46.900 --> 00:14:48.160
Come on!

00:14:52.490 --> 00:14:53.660
It's flying!

00:14:57.960 --> 00:14:59.940
You did it, Hakuryu!

00:15:00.810 --> 00:15:02.960
Hey, you're heavy!

00:15:07.200 --> 00:15:07.970
Hakuryu?

00:15:11.220 --> 00:15:12.920
Did something happen?

00:15:12.920 --> 00:15:14.950
Hakuryu, I'm coming, too!

00:15:17.840 --> 00:15:19.300
You're so slippery...

00:15:22.210 --> 00:15:25.240
Dewgong! You came back
at just the right time!

00:15:28.080 --> 00:15:30.820
I-I got it! I got it, already!

00:15:30.820 --> 00:15:31.490
Satoshi!

00:15:31.490 --> 00:15:32.450
Yeah!

00:15:32.980 --> 00:15:37.010
You go on, Hakuryu.
We'll be right behind you.

00:15:42.420 --> 00:15:44.130
Follow that Hakuryu,
Dewgong!

00:15:50.130 --> 00:15:53.810
Operation "Pretend to be shipwrecked
and lure in Kairyu"...

00:15:53.810 --> 00:15:55.890
...was a complete success, meow!

00:15:56.340 --> 00:15:57.830
Wow, that actually worked.

00:15:57.830 --> 00:15:58.890
Of course it did!

00:15:58.890 --> 00:16:03.410
With my world-class acting skill,
it was like taking candy from a Bayleaf!

00:16:11.740 --> 00:16:13.180
Hey! Quit struggling!

00:16:13.180 --> 00:16:14.880
What's that?!
One of Kairyu's friends?!

00:16:14.880 --> 00:16:17.740
Well then, you can keep each other company
in the cage, meow!

00:16:18.220 --> 00:16:19.750
What are you people doing?!

00:16:19.750 --> 00:16:22.860
If you ask us
"What are you people doing?!"...

00:16:22.860 --> 00:16:25.840
We'll answer out of
sympathy for the world!

00:16:26.410 --> 00:16:29.010
To protect the world from devastation.

00:16:29.010 --> 00:16:31.880
To preserve world peace.

00:16:31.890 --> 00:16:35.300
Championing the evils
of truth and love.

00:16:35.300 --> 00:16:38.100
We're the lovely, charming villains.

00:16:38.650 --> 00:16:39.430
Musashi!

00:16:39.430 --> 00:16:40.390
Kojiro!

00:16:41.130 --> 00:16:44.440
The Team Rocket duo
soars through the galaxy!

00:16:44.440 --> 00:16:47.320
Like a white hole,
a white tomorrow awaits us!

00:16:47.320 --> 00:16:49.650
Just kidding, meow!

00:16:53.900 --> 00:16:56.030
Team Rocket! Let Kairyu go!

00:16:56.030 --> 00:16:58.660
No, thanks!
We <i>did</i> finally catch it!

00:16:58.660 --> 00:17:01.980
And then Pikachu shows up...
Our ship truly has come in!

00:17:01.980 --> 00:17:04.880
We'll do a triple catch;
Kairyu, Hakuryu <i>and</i> Pikachu,

00:17:04.880 --> 00:17:07.670
and then we'll offer them all up
to Sakaki, meow!

00:17:08.160 --> 00:17:10.670
C'mon, vending!

00:17:16.130 --> 00:17:18.050
Rocket Vending Secret!

00:17:27.340 --> 00:17:29.510
Huh? Just one this time?

00:17:29.510 --> 00:17:30.740
Oh, well...

00:17:30.740 --> 00:17:31.190
Get' em!
Oh, well...

00:17:31.190 --> 00:17:32.650
Get' em!

00:17:36.070 --> 00:17:36.080
The Float Whale Pokémon, Whaloh!

00:17:36.080 --> 00:17:38.740
It's huge!
Float Whale Pokémon
Whaloh

00:17:38.740 --> 00:17:39.080
One ball,
but twice as nice, meow!
It's huge!
Float Whale Pokémon
Whaloh

00:17:39.080 --> 00:17:41.080
One ball,
but twice as nice, meow!

00:17:41.080 --> 00:17:43.870
But the only move it's got is <i>Flop</i>.

00:17:43.870 --> 00:17:49.580
No problem! A Flop from an amazing Pokémon's
gonna be one epic Flop, for sure, meow!

00:17:49.580 --> 00:17:51.960
Of course.
Well, use Flop then, Whaloh!

00:17:54.300 --> 00:17:55.300
Here it comes!

00:18:03.550 --> 00:18:05.950
Quite the epic Flop indeed...

00:18:05.950 --> 00:18:07.140
That was scary, meow...

00:18:07.140 --> 00:18:08.770
Now, Satoshi!

00:18:08.770 --> 00:18:10.940
Pikachu! Iron Tail!

00:18:20.130 --> 00:18:21.240
Well done!

00:18:21.240 --> 00:18:23.000
They'll get away at this rate!

00:18:23.000 --> 00:18:24.300
Not happening, meow!

00:18:24.300 --> 00:18:25.000
Well, duh!

00:18:25.460 --> 00:18:27.870
Whaloh! Use Flop on Kairyu!

00:18:46.100 --> 00:18:47.060
Satoshi!

00:18:53.570 --> 00:18:54.570
Hakuryu!

00:19:18.720 --> 00:19:20.800
You evolved?!

00:19:21.720 --> 00:19:23.930
Now there's
twice the Kairyu, too...

00:19:23.930 --> 00:19:25.830
What a wondrous moment!

00:19:25.830 --> 00:19:28.080
Hey! This ain't the time
to be awestruck!

00:19:28.080 --> 00:19:29.610
Let's catch it!

00:19:33.360 --> 00:19:35.860
Whoa, it's crazy mad...

00:19:38.250 --> 00:19:39.870
Would you like to come with us?

00:19:39.870 --> 00:19:41.390
Just kidding...

00:19:41.820 --> 00:19:44.700
<i>What an awful feeling!</i>

00:19:51.500 --> 00:19:53.830
Didn't expect it to evolve
so quickly...

00:19:53.830 --> 00:19:57.150
Hey, Go. I figured it out.

00:19:57.150 --> 00:19:58.090
What?

00:19:58.090 --> 00:20:00.580
The reason why Kairyu grow arms.

00:20:01.510 --> 00:20:03.850
It's gotta be so they can
protect others!

00:20:05.460 --> 00:20:08.350
That sounds pretty great!

00:20:08.350 --> 00:20:09.390
Doesn't it?

00:20:09.390 --> 00:20:10.400
Yeah!

00:20:11.350 --> 00:20:13.650
All right, let's go home.

00:20:13.650 --> 00:20:15.110
Whoa!

00:20:15.500 --> 00:20:17.390
C-Can't breathe...

00:20:19.590 --> 00:20:21.610
Wait, you...?

00:20:23.490 --> 00:20:25.720
It wants you to catch it?

00:20:27.860 --> 00:20:30.370
Thank you!
That really makes me happy!

00:20:30.870 --> 00:20:33.120
Kairyu, I'm looking forward
to working with you!

00:20:46.600 --> 00:20:48.690
I got Kairyu!

00:20:59.690 --> 00:21:01.400
Incredible!

00:21:01.400 --> 00:21:05.470
I can't believe the Kairyu island
really existed!

00:21:05.470 --> 00:21:06.950
Well done!

00:21:08.210 --> 00:21:10.490
This announcement will cause
quite a commotion!

00:21:10.490 --> 00:21:12.130
Perhaps.

00:21:12.730 --> 00:21:15.370
But let's keep quiet about it.

00:21:15.750 --> 00:21:17.440
Why?

00:21:17.440 --> 00:21:19.130
It's such a grand discovery!

00:21:19.560 --> 00:21:21.630
I think...

00:21:21.630 --> 00:21:26.090
...the mystery surrounding the Kairyu
is part of their appeal!

00:21:27.380 --> 00:21:29.510
I can't breathe!

00:21:29.510 --> 00:21:33.040
Satoshi and Go have found
the rumored Kairyu island,

00:21:33.040 --> 00:21:35.850
and gained a new friend
while they were there.

00:21:36.350 --> 00:21:41.520
The two will aim for their own heights,
as their adventure continues!
